{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10060","headline":"湘灵鼓瑟 · 魏璀","name":"湘灵鼓瑟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑶瑟多哀怨，朱弦且莫听。\n扁舟三楚客，藂竹二妃灵。\n淅沥闻余响，依稀欲辨形。\n柱间寒水碧，曲里暮山青。\n良马悲衔草，游鱼思绕萍。\n知音若相遇，终不滞南溟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏璀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}